{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"GeneralLedgerSummary\">General Ledger Summary</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action And Business Code General_ledger GeneralLedgerSummary Is Off On Position Summary Transaction Transactions View\"><code>General Ledger Summary</code> provides a concise overview of all financial transactions recorded in the general ledger, offering a snapshot of your business's financial performance and position over a specified period.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Code Create General_ledger GeneralLedgerSummary NewReport On Port Reports Summary To ToDate\">To create a new <code>General Ledger Summary</code>, go to <code>Reports</code> tab, click <code>General Ledger Summary</code>, then <code>New Report</code> button.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"mt-4 ms-4 pe-8 items-center bg-neutral-100 p-4 border-neutral-200 border-s border-t rounded-ss-lg flex gap-4 shadow-[inset_0px_1px_0px_#fff]\"><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-neutral-300 [text-shadow:_1px_1px_0px_#fff]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"GeneralLedgerSummary\">General Ledger Summary</span></span><span class=\"text-neutral-300 hover:text-neutral-400\"><i class=\"fas fa-square-question\" style=\"font-size: 16px\"></i></span><span class=\"bg-white text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-300 font-semibold rounded-md py-2 px-4 text-sm\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NewReport\">New Report</span></span></div></div>",
  "key": "general-ledger-summary-list"
